  TextFields:
  - <line-height=120%>Andromeda<br>& Perseus
  - "E\u2014\nWell, I solved the puzzle... I needed to get to Chicago to get the
    word out. Stupid Recovery Board cut off my radio access. \n\nIf you see this:
    you\u2019re invited to a Draconid watch party. October 8th at Loyola Beach, Chicago.
    I\u2019ll be looking for you.\n\nMaybe we\u2019ll finally know if we\u2019re
    just two distant stars\u2014\nor part of the same constellation after all.\nLove,\nA\n\nPS
    Tune the radio to 600MHz at 8pm on Oct 5 if you are back! "
  LowResTextFields:
  - {fileID: 0}
  - {fileID: 0}
